WEBVTT

01:30.530 --> 01:34.880
[The Unclouded Soul]

01:35.250 --> 01:37.880
[Episode 10]

01:54.350 --> 01:55.479
So beautiful.

01:59.479 --> 02:01.080
Then pick your favorite one.

02:09.430 --> 02:10.490
This one, this one.

02:47.079 --> 02:47.680
Please.

02:57.120 --> 02:57.680
Be good.

03:00.040 --> 03:01.390
♪ My heart braves countless tribulations ♪

03:00.680 --> 03:01.280
Be good.

03:02.620 --> 03:04.680
♪ Seeking the prophecy of fate ♪

03:03.120 --> 03:03.920
Are you ready?

03:06.390 --> 03:07.900
♪ Memories are flickering ♪

03:07.120 --> 03:07.870
I'm ready.

03:09.000 --> 03:11.080
♪ Our fingertips touched,
and then passed ♪

03:12.520 --> 03:14.610
♪ Binding silent wishes,
witnessed by the heaven and earth ♪

03:15.880 --> 03:18.110
♪ I'm only waiting for you ♪

03:19.430 --> 03:21.690
♪ In a breath,
travel over millions of years ♪

03:22.920 --> 03:25.070
♪ To rewrite it ♪

03:26.420 --> 03:28.060
♪ The obsession of my life ♪

03:29.130 --> 03:31.040
♪ Has never perished
in the reincarnation ♪

03:32.050 --> 03:34.860
♪ At the very beginning of all worlds,
I'd give up everything ♪

03:36.020 --> 03:40.740
♪To reverse time and space
just to find my most beloved ♪

03:42.270 --> 03:44.990
♪ Even if I have to lose my love again ♪

03:43.000 --> 03:44.730
More vitality would be better.

03:46.060 --> 03:48.190
♪ I only wish
to return to our first meeting ♪

03:49.320 --> 03:51.520
♪ Let the restricted longing ♪

03:52.870 --> 03:55.400
♪ Break the boundary of heaven and earth ♪

03:56.710 --> 03:58.110
♪ One thought turned love
into a fated calamity ♪

03:59.700 --> 04:01.380
♪ If we pray in tears ♪

04:02.810 --> 04:04.870
♪ In the vast mortal world ♪

04:06.150 --> 04:08.330
♪ Just to see you ♪

04:09.670 --> 04:11.790
♪ Once again ♪

04:15.650 --> 04:17.779
♪ Binding silent wishes,
witnessed by the heaven and earth ♪

04:19.060 --> 04:21.230
♪ I'm only waiting for you ♪

04:22.520 --> 04:24.820
♪ In a breath,
travel over millions of years ♪

04:25.930 --> 04:28.170
♪ Back to the beginning ♪

04:29.700 --> 04:31.090
♪ The obsession of my life ♪

04:32.200 --> 04:34.040
♪ The contract
that fate won't let us break ♪

04:35.270 --> 04:38.450
♪ Away from the crowd,
break free from the chains ♪

04:39.440 --> 04:40.640
♪ To make it whole ♪

04:41.980 --> 04:44.650
♪ Even if I have to lose my love again ♪

04:45.909 --> 04:47.790
♪ I only wish
to return to our first meeting ♪

04:49.060 --> 04:51.150
♪ Let the restricted longing ♪

04:52.770 --> 04:55.270
♪ Break the boundary of heaven and earth ♪

04:56.420 --> 04:57.830
♪ One thought turned love
into a fated calamity ♪

04:59.100 --> 05:01.100
♪ Hand in hand, we pray together ♪

05:02.700 --> 05:04.460
♪ One glance, a timeless span ♪

05:06.010 --> 05:07.940
♪ Burn up all the fleeting time ♪

05:09.560 --> 05:11.320
♪ Across the sky ♪

05:16.570 --> 05:20.620
♪ Just to be in love with you ♪

05:26.920 --> 05:27.750
Try the other ear.

05:27.750 --> 05:28.560
Ouch! Ouch!

05:28.560 --> 05:29.290
Does it hurt?

05:31.160 --> 05:32.159
I'll try this one.

05:34.920 --> 05:36.480
Do you have any of these
shaped like a pig?

05:36.480 --> 05:37.070
No.

05:37.480 --> 05:38.000
Nothing looks like you there.

05:38.000 --> 05:38.630
There's something else.

05:38.630 --> 05:39.360
Same for you.

05:43.920 --> 05:46.560
Luoluo, do you think Xiao Yao
would like this one?

05:46.560 --> 05:48.290
It looks quite similar to mine.

05:49.430 --> 05:50.390
I want to eat it.

05:50.720 --> 05:51.720
You can taste whichever one you like.

05:51.720 --> 05:53.310
Luoluo, why are you always
thinking about eating?

05:53.310 --> 05:54.480
It smells so good.

05:54.600 --> 05:55.390
Shut up.

05:56.240 --> 05:57.440
It smells wonderful.

05:57.800 --> 05:59.510
Why is your skin so delicate?

05:59.510 --> 06:01.600
Ms. Fairy, if I use your fragrant balm,

06:01.600 --> 06:03.110
will I look like you?

06:03.480 --> 06:05.210
Your skin is already delicate,

06:05.480 --> 06:06.680
but if you use our fragrant balm,

06:06.680 --> 06:08.740
it will become even better than ours.

06:08.920 --> 06:09.820
I want it!

06:09.850 --> 06:10.830
Let me try it!

06:10.830 --> 06:11.510
I want one too!

06:11.510 --> 06:12.370
I want that one!

06:12.510 --> 06:13.510
I want one too!

06:17.120 --> 06:18.380
They're so beautiful.

06:19.390 --> 06:20.480
Ms. Fairy,

06:20.480 --> 06:22.560
where is this fragrant balm from?

06:23.680 --> 06:24.940
Realm of Mist and Void.

06:25.510 --> 06:26.160
Where is that?

06:26.160 --> 06:26.870
What kind of place is it?

06:26.870 --> 06:28.240
Have you heard of it?

06:28.830 --> 06:30.940
The Realm of Mist and Void
rests on the sea.

06:30.940 --> 06:32.600
It's a paradise for women,

06:32.950 --> 06:35.220
where women are respected above all.

06:35.390 --> 06:36.650
No men to oppress them.

06:36.830 --> 06:38.159
No arranged marriages.

06:38.480 --> 06:39.830
In the Realm of Mist and Void,

06:39.830 --> 06:41.270
women never age,

06:41.590 --> 06:43.920
always remaining as delicate as flowers.

06:44.920 --> 06:46.270
No wonder they're so beautiful.

06:46.270 --> 06:47.800
Can I go there too, Ms. Fairy?

06:47.800 --> 06:49.070
Does such a place really exist?

06:49.070 --> 06:49.510
Is it true?

06:49.510 --> 06:50.920
Of course it exists.

06:50.950 --> 06:51.720
Who is this?

06:54.510 --> 06:55.240
A fairy!

06:55.310 --> 06:56.000
A fairy!

06:56.000 --> 06:57.310
So beautiful!

06:57.310 --> 06:58.390
Is she a fairy?

07:02.120 --> 07:02.950
A fairy.

07:16.270 --> 07:18.330
Is she a celestial being from heaven?

07:18.680 --> 07:19.750
So beautiful!

07:19.950 --> 07:22.410
The 4 of us
are from the Realm of Mist and Void.

07:22.950 --> 07:24.600
All the goods in this shop

07:24.870 --> 07:27.270
are handmade
by our sisters from the realm.

07:27.870 --> 07:29.610
We now offer them to you as gifts,

07:29.610 --> 07:31.870
hoping to connect with kindred spirits.

07:33.040 --> 07:34.190
I want that one!

07:35.830 --> 07:37.480
Look at these fragrant ointments.

07:37.480 --> 07:38.750
Girls all love them.

07:38.750 --> 07:40.550
How about we get one for Xiao Yao?

07:41.600 --> 07:43.000
But we don't have any money.

07:43.000 --> 07:44.330
What can we use to buy it?

07:44.360 --> 07:45.430
Didn't you say that good looks

07:45.430 --> 07:47.040
can bewitch people's hearts?

07:47.040 --> 07:48.270
Look at this girl.

07:48.950 --> 07:50.680
She looks so adorably lovable.

07:51.680 --> 07:52.560
Come here quickly.

07:52.560 --> 07:53.760
She's talking to you.

07:54.310 --> 07:55.830
I knew you looked special.

07:58.870 --> 08:00.270
Your skin is so delicate.

08:00.270 --> 08:01.270
You're so pretty.

08:02.190 --> 08:03.340
If you use these,

08:03.370 --> 08:05.100
you'll look even more radiant.

08:06.190 --> 08:07.620
Feel free to pick anything

08:07.620 --> 08:08.820
from this counter.

08:09.480 --> 08:11.720
-Ms. Fairy, I want one too!
-I want one too!

08:11.720 --> 08:13.320
I don't have that much money.

08:13.800 --> 08:14.950
She's so lucky!

08:16.430 --> 08:18.040
I'm so envious of her!

08:19.480 --> 08:20.870
Can I have this as a gift?

08:21.310 --> 08:21.920
Of course.

08:22.310 --> 08:23.310
Go ahead and choose.

08:23.310 --> 08:24.160
I have something too!

08:24.160 --> 08:25.800
Ms. Fairy, I have something too.

08:25.800 --> 08:26.830
I have a hairpin.

08:29.830 --> 08:31.480
This is a rouge box.

08:32.429 --> 08:33.559
I have a hairpin too!

08:35.030 --> 08:35.720
Mine is better!

08:35.720 --> 08:38.049
-The green one looks better.
-Pink. Pink.

08:41.270 --> 08:42.470
Thank you, Ms. Fairy.

08:43.100 --> 08:43.870
Young lady.

08:44.630 --> 08:46.030
I see you have a special connection

08:46.030 --> 08:47.270
with the Realm of Mist and Void.

08:47.270 --> 08:49.510
There are some special items
inside the shop.

08:49.510 --> 08:51.310
Would you like to come in and see?

08:51.670 --> 08:52.630
Yes, I'd love to.

08:53.120 --> 08:53.550
Follow me.

08:53.550 --> 08:54.610
I'd like to as well.

08:55.390 --> 08:56.840
How can I get in?

08:58.200 --> 08:59.470
I want to go in too!

09:00.200 --> 09:01.080
Ms. Fairy!

09:01.200 --> 09:02.300
Ms. Fairy!

09:24.630 --> 09:25.750
So beautiful.

09:26.480 --> 09:28.120
Come closer and look.

09:28.630 --> 09:30.090
It's even more beautiful.

09:44.080 --> 09:46.080
Who is the person in this portrait?

09:46.720 --> 09:48.510
Is it someone imaginary

09:48.550 --> 09:49.670
or someone real?

09:49.960 --> 09:51.490
The person in this painting

09:51.550 --> 09:53.670
is the most beautiful being
in the Three Realms,

09:53.670 --> 09:55.730
the queen of all flowers in the world,

09:55.910 --> 09:57.570
called Dreamshard Immortal.

09:58.720 --> 10:00.600
We are all her disciples.

10:02.120 --> 10:03.240
She herself

10:04.120 --> 10:07.120
is a thousandfold more beautiful
than this portrait.

10:08.000 --> 10:08.480
So,

10:09.000 --> 10:10.510
where is she?

10:11.750 --> 10:12.720
Dreamshard Immortal lives

10:12.720 --> 10:15.240
in the Realm of Mist and Void
on the celestial mountain beyond the sea.

10:15.240 --> 10:17.300
Only women with the sincerest hearts

10:17.670 --> 10:19.320
can see her true face.

10:20.840 --> 10:22.440
If a girl is naturally gifted

10:22.510 --> 10:24.480
and destined to meet Dreamshard Immortal,

10:24.480 --> 10:26.280
she may be accepted as a disciple

10:26.790 --> 10:28.790
and enjoy eternal youth and beauty.

10:31.030 --> 10:33.440
I can see
you're exceptionally intelligent,

10:33.440 --> 10:35.040
far from an ordinary mortal.

10:35.830 --> 10:36.630
Me?

10:37.150 --> 10:37.720
Yes.

10:45.870 --> 10:47.270
Take this portrait home,

10:48.030 --> 10:49.140
hang it by your bed,

10:49.240 --> 10:50.960
and make offerings of fresh flowers daily.

10:50.960 --> 10:52.290
With sincere devotion,

10:52.600 --> 10:56.530
Dreamshard Immortal will come
to take you to the Realm of Mist and Void.

11:03.120 --> 11:04.000
Ms. Fairy,

11:04.360 --> 11:05.480
I'd like to ask,

11:06.360 --> 11:08.240
why are you being so nice to me?

11:10.600 --> 11:11.270
Because

11:12.360 --> 11:15.820
sooner or later, we'll be sisters
in the Realm of Mist and Void.

11:17.360 --> 11:18.630
So how did they agree

11:18.630 --> 11:20.430
to teach you how to make noodles?

11:20.870 --> 11:21.910
Didn't you tell me

11:22.440 --> 11:25.500
that silver is the most useful thing
in the human realm?

11:26.550 --> 11:28.280
So how much silver did you give?

11:28.390 --> 11:29.850
I don't remember exactly.

11:30.270 --> 11:30.960
100 taels?

11:31.720 --> 11:32.550
Or maybe 200.

11:33.480 --> 11:34.000
You...

11:34.630 --> 11:35.840
With that much silver,

11:35.840 --> 11:37.870
you could buy the entire noodle shop,

11:37.870 --> 11:39.670
but we only ate 2 bowls of noodles.

11:39.670 --> 11:41.270
But I wasn't buying noodles.

11:41.630 --> 11:43.230
I was buying your happiness.

11:49.120 --> 11:49.960
Xiao Yao!

11:51.200 --> 11:52.030
Xiao Yao!

11:54.320 --> 11:55.000
Xiao Yao!

11:55.840 --> 11:56.390
My Lord.

11:57.600 --> 11:59.200
Xiao Yao, yesterday was your birthday.

11:59.200 --> 12:01.320
Luoluo and I were looking everywhere
for gifts,

12:01.320 --> 12:02.480
but we're still late.

12:02.480 --> 12:03.410
Not late at all.

12:03.670 --> 12:05.080
Thank you for being so thoughtful.

12:05.080 --> 12:07.080
Congratulations on your birthday.

12:08.480 --> 12:09.180
My Lord.

12:09.360 --> 12:12.690
We need to speak with Xiao Yao
about something. Is that okay?

12:13.510 --> 12:14.440
Would you like to see

12:14.440 --> 12:16.110
the gift we prepared for you?

12:18.510 --> 12:19.040
Let's go.

12:21.320 --> 12:21.670
Let's go.

12:21.670 --> 12:22.400
I'm leaving.

12:25.200 --> 12:25.910
Slow down.

12:27.720 --> 12:29.240
Quickly, show it to Xiao Yao.

12:29.240 --> 12:30.120
Take a look.

12:31.510 --> 12:32.440
Happy birthday.

12:33.240 --> 12:33.670
Take a look.

12:33.670 --> 12:34.270
Thank you.

12:36.480 --> 12:37.270
What is this?

12:37.670 --> 12:38.530
Fragrant balm.

12:38.840 --> 12:40.910
Apply this to your face every day,

12:41.120 --> 12:43.720
and you'll stay youthful
and radiant forever.

12:45.240 --> 12:46.080
It smells wonderful.

12:46.080 --> 12:46.740
Doesn't it?

12:48.510 --> 12:49.640
Where did you get it?

12:49.750 --> 12:50.960
From the Garden of Mist and Void.

12:50.960 --> 12:51.910
I traded the flower from my head

12:51.910 --> 12:53.610
with someone from the garden.

12:53.670 --> 12:56.270
This fragrant balm
comes from the Realm of Mist and Void.

12:56.270 --> 12:57.530
Realm of Mist and Void?

12:57.840 --> 12:58.870
What kind of place is that?

12:58.870 --> 13:00.970
It is a wonderful place.

13:01.480 --> 13:03.390
It's inhabited entirely
by immortal maidens.

13:03.390 --> 13:04.790
There are no men there,

13:04.910 --> 13:05.840
only women.

13:06.120 --> 13:08.080
All they do there every day

13:08.480 --> 13:10.480
is make themselves more beautiful.

13:10.630 --> 13:11.120
Really?

13:11.120 --> 13:11.550
Yes.

13:11.720 --> 13:13.320
Among them,
there's one who is the most beautiful,

13:13.320 --> 13:14.980
called Dreamshard Immortal.

13:15.480 --> 13:16.960
Today, they gave me a painting—

13:16.960 --> 13:18.000
only for me.

13:18.000 --> 13:18.440
Let me show you.

13:18.440 --> 13:19.000
Show me quickly.

13:19.000 --> 13:19.600
Let me see.

13:20.480 --> 13:22.280
It's exceptionally beautiful.

13:24.870 --> 13:26.000
Isn't it beautiful?

13:26.840 --> 13:28.010
It's so beautiful.

13:28.120 --> 13:28.870
Right?

13:33.510 --> 13:34.720
No! Throw it away quickly!

13:34.720 --> 13:35.480
Why?

13:38.630 --> 13:39.960
What's wrong, Xiao Yao?

13:50.290 --> 13:51.620
[Pei] [Zhirui]

13:52.230 --> 13:53.630
[Ying Ning]

13:54.070 --> 13:55.250
[Pianpian]

13:58.120 --> 13:59.080
Flower Demon,

13:59.670 --> 14:01.870
I saw through your true form at a glance.

14:02.630 --> 14:04.330
We've been waiting outside
for over a month

14:04.330 --> 14:05.150
and still couldn't find

14:05.150 --> 14:07.410
a way through Demons' Valley's barrier.

14:07.940 --> 14:10.510
Thankfully, you brought
Dreamshard Immortal's portrait in.

14:10.510 --> 14:12.630
So we can find our way
into Demons' Valley.

14:12.630 --> 14:13.340
What?

14:26.420 --> 14:27.520
Xiao Yao, run!

14:28.270 --> 14:28.910
Luoluo!

15:34.750 --> 15:36.570
The minor demon still got away?

15:36.670 --> 15:37.790
I've tied her up

15:38.100 --> 15:39.500
and left her in the woods.

15:39.960 --> 15:40.860
Take her

15:41.030 --> 15:42.830
back to the cliff and wait for me.

15:42.870 --> 15:44.200
Where are you going now?

15:47.390 --> 15:49.960
I'm going to meet the Demon King, Hong Ye.

15:51.600 --> 15:52.860
What's wrong with you?

15:56.870 --> 15:59.000
This is Dreamshard Immortal's order.

15:59.320 --> 15:59.870
Or maybe,

16:00.320 --> 16:01.450
you can come with me?

16:01.960 --> 16:02.560
Forget it.

16:03.150 --> 16:05.150
I'll wait for you at the cliff ahead.

16:10.750 --> 16:12.750
-Why are you here?
-Why are you here?

16:16.600 --> 16:17.130
Which one

16:18.320 --> 16:19.510
of you is the real one?

16:19.510 --> 16:20.550
Quick! Catch her!

16:20.630 --> 16:21.920
Quick! Catch her!

16:22.200 --> 16:23.600
Quick. Help me fight her!

16:27.750 --> 16:29.550
Why aren't you doing something?

16:29.910 --> 16:31.710
Why aren't you doing something?

16:33.150 --> 16:34.330
You two fight it out.

16:34.630 --> 16:35.690
Whoever wins

16:35.910 --> 16:37.390
must be the real one.

16:37.410 --> 16:38.650
Whose side are you on?

16:38.870 --> 16:40.470
Whose side are you really on?

16:46.030 --> 16:47.920
I choose you. You're the real one.

16:48.000 --> 16:49.400
Quick. Help me fight her.

16:57.080 --> 16:57.780
Ying Ning.

16:57.910 --> 16:59.570
Do you truly not recognize me?

16:59.630 --> 17:01.230
You, me, Zhirui, and Pei,

17:01.320 --> 17:02.420
by Dreamshard Immortal's command,

17:02.420 --> 17:04.160
came to Demons' Valley
to deliver a message to Hong Ye.

17:04.160 --> 17:05.490
Ask that one over there.

17:09.640 --> 17:11.310
You almost ruined everything!

17:11.310 --> 17:11.910
After her!

17:15.920 --> 17:16.510
Stop!

17:19.510 --> 17:20.109
Xiao Ming!

17:20.109 --> 17:21.270
Whenever you're in danger,

17:21.270 --> 17:22.400
you always look for Xiao Ming.

17:22.400 --> 17:23.310
Look carefully.

17:23.310 --> 17:24.160
I'm Xiao Mu.

17:27.720 --> 17:28.430
Pianpian.

17:28.550 --> 17:29.550
Subdue this cat demon.

17:29.550 --> 17:31.680
I'll wait for you at our previous spot.

18:00.240 --> 18:00.890
My Lord,

18:01.230 --> 18:03.830
Xiao Yao has been taken away
by her accomplices.

18:03.830 --> 18:05.340
This woman is human,

18:05.790 --> 18:07.250
yet she knows demonic arts

18:07.350 --> 18:09.400
and somehow entered Demons' Valley.

18:09.400 --> 18:10.920
You're from the Realm of Mist and Void?

18:10.920 --> 18:11.550
Exactly.

18:12.200 --> 18:14.110
The Monarch of All Demons has returned,

18:14.110 --> 18:16.230
yet hasn't come
to see Dreamshard Immortal.

18:16.230 --> 18:18.280
So she sent me to pay a visit.

18:18.560 --> 18:20.960
I have no interest
in any dealings with her.

18:21.350 --> 18:22.940
Return Xiao Yao to me.

18:26.400 --> 18:28.260
Please rest assured, Demon King.

18:28.270 --> 18:29.800
We won't harm her in any way.

18:30.280 --> 18:32.120
We simply wish to invite you

18:32.750 --> 18:35.280
to speak with Dreamshard Immortal
in person.

18:38.310 --> 18:39.070
My Lord!

18:39.650 --> 18:41.380
Hong Ye, don't bother about me.

18:47.110 --> 18:47.570
Tell us,

18:47.960 --> 18:49.690
where is Dreamshard Immortal?

19:04.350 --> 19:05.080
Hong Ye,

19:05.260 --> 19:06.680
100 years ago, you went to great lengths

19:06.680 --> 19:08.740
to piece together the Kunlun Mirror,

19:09.110 --> 19:11.170
but you gave it to humans for nothing,

19:11.370 --> 19:13.110
which cost you your life.

19:14.110 --> 19:15.910
Now that you've awakened again,

19:16.050 --> 19:17.850
I fear your kind heart

19:18.590 --> 19:20.310
will be deceived by humans once more.

19:20.310 --> 19:21.000
I want

19:21.370 --> 19:23.630
to invite you
to the Realm of Mist and Void

19:23.680 --> 19:24.720
for a little chat.

19:25.400 --> 19:26.160
I have

19:27.030 --> 19:28.630
nothing to discuss with you.

19:28.680 --> 19:29.400
Pianpian.

19:31.030 --> 19:32.470
Present my gift.

19:46.680 --> 19:47.410
It's poison!

19:48.750 --> 19:49.160
You...

19:50.980 --> 19:52.980
I made this specially for you.

19:53.270 --> 19:55.400
It's called Heart-Devouring Poison.

19:55.590 --> 19:57.450
If you accept this gift,

19:57.680 --> 19:59.750
I'll have them release

20:00.030 --> 20:01.110
these minor demons.

20:01.110 --> 20:02.910
My Lord, you absolutely cannot!

20:06.880 --> 20:08.160
Hong Ye, don't.

20:22.160 --> 20:23.240
Hong Ye.

20:24.200 --> 20:25.730
Though your power is great,

20:26.830 --> 20:28.490
you have too many weaknesses.

20:29.900 --> 20:31.500
If you want to neutralize it,

20:32.150 --> 20:33.240
come within 7 days

20:34.070 --> 20:35.670
to the Realm of Mist and Void.

20:49.240 --> 20:49.840
It's fine.

20:52.400 --> 20:54.000
Then we'll be waiting for you

20:54.830 --> 20:57.090
in the Realm of Mist and Void, Demon King.

21:05.270 --> 21:06.510
Dreamshard Immortal,

21:06.510 --> 21:08.960
whose identity lies
between the Three Realms,

21:08.960 --> 21:11.580
is neither human, nor demon, nor immortal.

21:12.410 --> 21:13.610
She's called Spirit.

21:13.750 --> 21:15.640
She was originally a fairy
from the Heavenly Realm.

21:15.640 --> 21:17.480
Later, she became enamored
with the human realm

21:17.480 --> 21:18.730
and descended to the realm
without permission.

21:18.730 --> 21:20.180
Then she married a human.

21:20.340 --> 21:22.200
Because she was tainted
by the impurities of the mortal world,

21:22.200 --> 21:24.260
she can never return
to the Heavenly Realm.

21:24.260 --> 21:26.830
She's been trapped in the cycle
of birth, aging, sickness, and death.

21:26.830 --> 21:28.560
To preserve her eternal youth,

21:28.840 --> 21:30.100
she replaced her heart

21:30.200 --> 21:31.510
with a crystal heart.

21:32.350 --> 21:33.010
Since then,

21:33.370 --> 21:35.920
she has survived
by consuming the essence of mortal women

21:35.920 --> 21:38.320
to maintain her beauty
and extend her life.

21:38.920 --> 21:40.390
The place where she resides

21:40.390 --> 21:41.660
is called the Realm of Mist and Void.

21:41.660 --> 21:42.940
In human legends,

21:43.760 --> 21:45.000
that place is known

21:45.570 --> 21:46.300
as Penglang.

21:47.810 --> 21:49.960
So does she live on a celestial mountain?

21:49.960 --> 21:52.410
It's merely a celestial mountain
imagined by humans.

21:52.410 --> 21:53.750
The true celestial mountains

21:53.750 --> 21:55.080
aren't so easily found.

21:55.080 --> 21:57.310
So she came to you for the Yuli Spring?

21:57.960 --> 21:58.620
Precisely.

21:59.200 --> 22:00.930
If she obtains the Yuli Spring,

22:01.070 --> 22:02.880
she can return to the Heavenly Realm.

22:02.880 --> 22:05.510
However, her true form can't leave
the Realm of Mist and Void.

22:05.510 --> 22:07.350
So she can only transform into a nightmare

22:07.350 --> 22:08.440
to gather disciples

22:08.440 --> 22:10.400
who collect mortal women for her

22:10.680 --> 22:12.350
and bring them
to the Realm of Mist and Void.

22:12.350 --> 22:13.410
Our Demons' Valley

22:14.000 --> 22:15.830
is surrounded by powerful enemies.

22:15.830 --> 22:17.630
I need everyone to work together

22:18.110 --> 22:19.640
and cultivate diligently.

22:19.720 --> 22:20.240
Yes.

22:20.680 --> 22:21.310
Yes.

22:25.920 --> 22:28.520
Xiao Mu,
lead everyone in proper cultivation.

22:34.160 --> 22:35.960
Let's continue with the lesson.

22:36.240 --> 22:39.040
Everyone, turn to chapter 3
of the Baize Drawings.

22:39.880 --> 22:41.510
Every record in it

22:41.750 --> 22:43.350
must be committed to memory.

22:44.680 --> 22:46.880
So when you encounter danger
in the future,

22:46.880 --> 22:48.440
you'll know how to respond.

22:49.650 --> 22:50.370
Xiao Yao.

22:51.640 --> 22:52.480
Xiao Yao.

23:03.640 --> 23:04.680
I'm sorry.

23:04.880 --> 23:07.880
I really didn't know
there was a trap in that portrait.

23:08.960 --> 23:09.960
I'm sorry.

23:10.920 --> 23:11.880
I'm sorry.

23:12.510 --> 23:14.710
We've brought trouble to His Lordship.

23:16.590 --> 23:17.920
You didn't know either.

23:20.790 --> 23:22.240
His Lordship's power is profound.

23:22.240 --> 23:23.240
He'll be fine.

23:25.440 --> 23:25.950
Yeah.

23:52.270 --> 23:52.880
My Lord!

23:53.790 --> 23:54.310
Go back.

24:00.400 --> 24:01.200
It's nothing.

24:01.920 --> 24:03.520
It wasn't like this just now.

24:04.400 --> 24:06.400
The Heart-Devouring Poison isn't fatal.

24:06.400 --> 24:08.330
It only draws out the evil thoughts

24:08.400 --> 24:10.130
that exist in a demon's nature.

24:11.070 --> 24:12.340
I have cultivated for 1,000 years.

24:12.340 --> 24:13.590
A tiny venomous insect

24:13.590 --> 24:14.590
is no match for me.

24:15.360 --> 24:16.640
I'll go to Youning Cave now

24:16.640 --> 24:17.940
to use my power to suppress it

24:17.940 --> 24:20.270
and slowly force the venomous insect out.

24:22.640 --> 24:23.110
Xiao Mu.

24:23.350 --> 24:23.720
Yes.

24:24.030 --> 24:25.180
Lead everyone in their cultivation.

24:25.180 --> 24:26.340
Without my permission,

24:26.340 --> 24:28.540
no one is allowed to enter Youning Cave.

24:29.240 --> 24:29.830
Yes.

24:36.440 --> 24:37.310
Go to class now.

24:38.400 --> 24:39.000
But...

24:40.640 --> 24:41.240
It's fine.

25:08.790 --> 25:09.440
Xiao Ming.

25:10.640 --> 25:11.970
I can't take it anymore.

25:17.820 --> 25:19.760
I've been at my limit for a while!

25:28.200 --> 25:29.660
How is His Lordship doing?

25:34.240 --> 25:34.920
I'm talking to you.

25:34.920 --> 25:36.380
How is His Lordship doing?

25:36.680 --> 25:38.510
He says he's fine,

25:39.070 --> 25:40.750
but since I've been by his side
for so many years,

25:40.750 --> 25:42.480
how could I not notice?

25:44.160 --> 25:46.300
He's just enduring it,

25:47.070 --> 25:49.400
pretending nothing's wrong.

25:50.680 --> 25:51.810
What do you mean?

25:54.000 --> 25:55.000
Dreamshard said,

25:55.690 --> 25:57.240
7 days is the limit,

25:58.550 --> 26:01.150
but
with His Lordship's current cultivation,

26:01.480 --> 26:04.680
suppressing it for 10 days
would be his absolute limit.

26:04.960 --> 26:07.220
If the poison takes effect after 10 days,

26:07.510 --> 26:08.510
what will happen?

26:12.920 --> 26:15.070
It's better not to witness it.

27:01.480 --> 27:02.200
Dreamshard Immortal

27:02.200 --> 27:04.920
lives in the Realm of Mist and Void
on a celestial mountain beyond the sea.

27:04.920 --> 27:06.980
Only women with the sincerest hearts

27:07.440 --> 27:09.040
can see her true appearance.

27:10.000 --> 27:11.600
If a girl is naturally gifted

27:11.680 --> 27:13.480
and destined to meet Dreamshard Immortal,

27:13.480 --> 27:15.280
she may be accepted as a disciple

27:15.750 --> 27:17.750
and enjoy eternal youth and beauty.

27:39.320 --> 27:40.200
Hei Wu!

27:41.160 --> 27:42.070
Get out now!

27:53.590 --> 27:54.160
My Lord,

27:54.830 --> 27:56.110
why have you summoned me

27:56.110 --> 27:57.070
so late at night?

27:58.070 --> 28:00.310
I know exactly what you're thinking.

28:02.960 --> 28:06.000
You two have been blinded by power.

28:07.720 --> 28:09.270
You would even put

28:09.270 --> 28:10.850
your own kind in danger.

28:12.440 --> 28:13.200
Today,

28:14.720 --> 28:17.370
I command you to leave Demons' Valley

28:18.000 --> 28:19.550
and never return.

28:25.240 --> 28:27.400
I've been blinded by power?

28:28.310 --> 28:29.720
Tell me which of my actions

28:29.720 --> 28:31.980
wasn't for the benefit of our demon kind.

28:32.070 --> 28:33.400
Now you tell me to leave.

28:34.830 --> 28:35.760
On what grounds?

29:49.270 --> 29:49.830
Xiao Yao.

29:50.240 --> 29:50.920
Hong Ye.

29:52.830 --> 29:53.960
How are you feeling?

30:08.680 --> 30:11.080
I wanted to give you
the jade pendant again.

30:11.270 --> 30:13.070
But with this poison unresolved,

30:13.070 --> 30:14.340
my presence near you

30:14.380 --> 30:16.200
will only put you in greater danger.

30:14.820 --> 30:18.160
♪ Fear that the red thread that bound us,
the vows we engraved ♪

30:17.840 --> 30:18.880
While I'm lucid,

30:19.050 --> 30:22.440
♪ The "forever" we swore are
meant to miss their mark ♪

30:19.920 --> 30:21.310
I've transfered my consciousness

30:21.310 --> 30:22.770
into this straw bracelet.

30:23.920 --> 30:26.050
It will surely keep you safe and sound.

30:26.720 --> 30:28.050
Why are you saying this?

30:28.760 --> 30:32.180
♪ Afraid of the exchanged life and death,
the arrows blocking the way ♪

30:28.880 --> 30:30.010
Where are you going?

30:33.030 --> 30:37.340
♪ The chains that are hard to break,
hard to distinguish ♪

30:33.110 --> 30:33.680
Hong Ye.

30:34.720 --> 30:35.590
Are you...

30:40.760 --> 30:43.200
♪ Perhaps it's all for nothing ♪

30:44.020 --> 30:46.700
♪ Love and hate are nothing more ♪

30:47.370 --> 30:51.840
♪ Than a scene we rush through ♪

30:54.990 --> 30:57.240
♪ Afraid of giving my true heart ♪

30:58.440 --> 31:00.830
♪ The obsession that rises like magpies ♪

31:03.090 --> 31:05.260
♪ Boiling hot ♪

31:09.860 --> 31:14.360
♪ You and I are like grass and trees
meeting in the depths of the clouds ♪

31:15.180 --> 31:19.610
♪ Like the red thread strung together,
hanging on a sharp sword ♪

31:20.540 --> 31:23.320
♪ Waiting for the heartbeat
to shatter time ♪

31:24.520 --> 31:25.950
♪ The chains of fate ♪

31:26.820 --> 31:30.600
♪ Belong to us, in the blink of an eye,
it's 1,000 years ♪

31:31.500 --> 31:35.110
♪ You and I meet across mountains
and rivers, under the bright moon ♪

31:35.970 --> 31:37.430
♪ The obsession that rises like magpies ♪

31:38.490 --> 31:40.000
♪ Both flushing ♪

31:40.940 --> 31:44.550
♪ Waiting to walk hand in hand
through the chessboard of fate ♪

31:45.480 --> 31:50.610
♪ The carefree moments that belong to us ♪

31:52.890 --> 31:54.680
♪ Moments ♪

32:14.310 --> 32:16.850
♪ The armor I dare not cast away ♪

32:16.160 --> 32:17.480
Xiao Mu. Xiao Mu.

32:17.750 --> 32:20.240
♪ The red cheeks ♪

32:19.200 --> 32:21.200
This is the message His Lordship left.

32:21.200 --> 32:22.410
"Since the venomous insect
can lure my heart,

32:22.200 --> 32:23.710
♪ Cold ♪

32:22.640 --> 32:24.310
I'm afraid I'll lose my nature.

32:24.310 --> 32:27.710
I've gone to the Realm of Mist and Void
to resolve this matter.

32:27.960 --> 32:30.020
Last night, I banished Hei Wu and Wu Huan

32:28.530 --> 32:30.850
♪ Perhaps it's all for nothing ♪

32:30.120 --> 32:31.320
from Demons' Valley.

32:31.990 --> 32:33.880
The barrier has been reinforced.

32:32.120 --> 32:33.670
♪ A thousand years is just ♪

32:34.540 --> 32:39.290
♪ A fleeting moment's grand display ♪

32:34.670 --> 32:36.110
You should say to outsiders

32:36.110 --> 32:38.480
that I am cultivating in Youning Cave.

32:39.960 --> 32:41.520
Do not act rashly.

32:42.110 --> 32:43.550
Wait quietly for my return."

32:43.420 --> 32:47.830
♪ You and I are like grass and trees
meeting in the depths of the clouds ♪

32:45.240 --> 32:46.500
You heard everything.

32:47.480 --> 32:49.180
We must follow His Lordship's instructions

32:48.630 --> 32:53.170
♪ Like the red thread strung together,
hanging on a sharp sword ♪

32:50.160 --> 32:52.560
and focus on our cultivation
in the valley.

32:54.100 --> 32:56.830
♪ Waiting for the heartbeat
to shatter time ♪

32:56.640 --> 32:58.130
You should hurry back to your cultivation.

32:57.920 --> 32:59.510
♪ The chains of fate ♪

32:59.350 --> 33:00.280
I'll go find him.

33:00.380 --> 33:04.160
♪ Belong to us, in the blink of an eye,
it's 1,000 years ♪

33:00.550 --> 33:02.950
Where exactly do you think
you'll find him?

33:04.730 --> 33:06.840
We don't even know
where the Realm of Mist and Void is.

33:04.910 --> 33:08.670
♪ You and I meet across mountains
and rivers, under the bright moon ♪

33:07.920 --> 33:10.220
If Hei Wu discovers His Lordship
is not in the valley

33:09.520 --> 33:10.980
♪ The obsession that rises like magpies ♪

33:10.720 --> 33:12.270
and conspires with other great demons

33:12.050 --> 33:13.560
♪ Both flushing ♪

33:12.920 --> 33:14.310
to attack Demons' Valley,

33:14.310 --> 33:15.540
what will happen to this place?

33:14.500 --> 33:18.110
♪ Waiting to walk hand in hand
through the chessboard of fate ♪

33:16.720 --> 33:18.360
Right now, all we can do

33:18.400 --> 33:19.450
is follow His Lordship's instructions.

33:19.040 --> 33:24.170
♪ The carefree moments that belong to us ♪

33:22.600 --> 33:24.730
Xiao Mu, why waste so many words on her?

33:25.300 --> 33:26.740
Xiao Yao, let me tell you.

33:27.230 --> 33:29.320
All this chaos happened because of you!

33:27.500 --> 33:30.110
♪ Moments ♪

33:29.920 --> 33:30.920
From now on,

33:30.920 --> 33:32.450
you'd better pray every day

33:32.680 --> 33:34.270
that His Lordship
can defeat Dreamshard Immortal

33:34.270 --> 33:35.330
and return safely.

33:35.880 --> 33:38.210
Otherwise, every demon in Demons' Valley

33:38.270 --> 33:39.800
will never forgive you!

33:52.550 --> 33:54.610
True feelings fade away like dreams.

33:55.750 --> 33:59.010
Reflections of flowers and the moon
are merely illusions.

34:44.630 --> 34:45.190
Hurry, let's go.

34:45.190 --> 34:45.790
Coming.

34:46.000 --> 34:49.060
Isn't Xiao Yao supposed
to be good at fortune-telling?

34:50.510 --> 34:51.840
Why can't she tell

34:52.590 --> 34:54.520
she was born under an unlucky star?

34:55.480 --> 34:56.590
You broomstick!

34:58.030 --> 34:59.690
Xiao Yao is suffering enough.

34:59.710 --> 35:00.810
Don't go too far.

35:00.880 --> 35:02.590
Isn't her suffering well-deserved?

35:02.590 --> 35:03.480
Because of her,

35:03.920 --> 35:04.510
our Demons' Valley

35:04.510 --> 35:06.510
has suffered disaster after disaster.

35:06.510 --> 35:07.670
Stop talking nonsense.

35:07.670 --> 35:09.190
This has nothing to do with Xiao Yao.

35:09.190 --> 35:09.920
That's right.

35:09.920 --> 35:12.190
We were the ones
who brought back that painting.

35:12.190 --> 35:12.510
Yes.

35:12.630 --> 35:13.880
Since I'm your classmate,

35:13.880 --> 35:15.480
let me give you both some advice.

35:15.480 --> 35:16.590
Stay away from her.

35:16.840 --> 35:17.920
Mind your own business.

35:17.920 --> 35:18.800
I'm warning you.

35:18.800 --> 35:20.000
Xiao Yao is our good friend.

35:20.000 --> 35:20.330
Yeah.

35:20.480 --> 35:22.070
Stop criticizing her like that!

35:22.070 --> 35:22.510
Right!

35:22.800 --> 35:24.670
Xiao Yao is my savior...

35:31.760 --> 35:34.220
I shouldn't have bothered
advising you two.

35:41.320 --> 35:41.800
Luoluo.

35:42.280 --> 35:43.320
Keep watch here.

35:43.400 --> 35:44.990
Grunt twice, no matter who comes.

35:44.990 --> 35:45.550
Yes.

35:53.000 --> 35:53.710
Dali.

35:54.760 --> 35:55.620
Come, quickly.

35:55.800 --> 35:56.660
This is for you.

35:57.670 --> 35:58.400
What is this?

35:58.440 --> 35:59.300
A safety charm.

36:00.920 --> 36:02.400
This isn't an ordinary charm.

36:02.400 --> 36:04.190
Luoluo and I risked our lives to steal it.

36:04.190 --> 36:05.280
You can use this charm

36:05.280 --> 36:07.140
to see if His Lordship is safe now.

36:08.360 --> 36:09.330
How do I use it?

36:09.800 --> 36:11.510
Just think of His Lordship in your heart

36:11.510 --> 36:12.640
and burn this charm.

36:12.710 --> 36:14.360
If it burns completely to ash,

36:14.360 --> 36:15.760
it means His Lordship is safe.

36:15.760 --> 36:17.290
Then you can stop worrying.

36:28.480 --> 36:30.560
What if it doesn't burn completely?

36:30.710 --> 36:31.640
Then it means...

36:34.800 --> 36:36.480
We can't think about that now, Xiao Yao.

36:36.480 --> 36:38.140
If you want to try it, hurry up.

36:38.230 --> 36:39.960
We're done for if we're caught.

36:55.400 --> 36:57.810
May it burn completely to ashes.

36:58.000 --> 36:58.670
Your peace

36:59.710 --> 37:00.480
is my peace.

37:01.150 --> 37:02.950
May it burn completely to ashes.

37:02.960 --> 37:03.670
Your peace

37:04.360 --> 37:05.020
is my peace.

37:24.110 --> 37:25.510
What are you 3 doing here?

37:25.880 --> 37:26.800
Not sleeping

37:26.800 --> 37:28.260
or cultivating properly,

37:28.360 --> 37:29.230
just gathering together

37:29.230 --> 37:30.500
and chattering away.

37:31.070 --> 37:31.320
We...

37:31.320 --> 37:32.470
We want to cultivate,

37:32.470 --> 37:33.480
but our minds aren't calm.

37:33.480 --> 37:34.940
We want to sleep but can't.

37:35.590 --> 37:36.720
Get some rest early.

37:37.110 --> 37:39.220
Don't miss tomorrow's morning class.

37:39.220 --> 37:39.870
Yes.

38:16.630 --> 38:17.230
Xiao Yao.

38:18.920 --> 38:20.580
Where are your 2 best friends?

38:24.760 --> 38:26.320
They cultivated too late last night.

38:26.320 --> 38:28.020
They probably overslept.

38:28.320 --> 38:29.650
I'll go wake them up now.

38:30.150 --> 38:30.710
No need.

38:32.320 --> 38:34.630
Show me the results
of your extra practice.

38:34.630 --> 38:36.280
If you've made significant progress,

38:36.280 --> 38:38.080
I'll give you all a day off today.

38:40.150 --> 38:40.650
Hurry!

38:53.400 --> 38:55.860
Are we going
to the Realm of Mist and Void now?

38:58.710 --> 39:00.170
Xiao Yao, I'm thinking...

39:00.510 --> 39:03.110
Even if we both reach
the Realm of Mist and Void,

39:03.440 --> 39:04.700
with just the two of us,

39:04.760 --> 39:06.490
what help could we possibly be?

39:07.230 --> 39:08.360
I don't know either.

39:08.550 --> 39:09.840
But if I just sit here waiting,

39:09.840 --> 39:10.800
doing nothing,

39:11.190 --> 39:13.210
I'll suffer like that charm.

39:13.360 --> 39:13.960
Yeah.

39:15.280 --> 39:15.800
Dali.

39:16.440 --> 39:17.630
This time is different from before.

39:17.630 --> 39:18.890
It could be dangerous.

39:19.110 --> 39:19.550
If...

39:19.550 --> 39:20.480
What do you mean?

39:20.670 --> 39:21.920
You don't want to take me?

39:21.920 --> 39:23.650
I'm definitely going with you.

39:23.840 --> 39:24.920
His Lordship has been taken away

39:24.920 --> 39:26.150
because of that painting

39:26.150 --> 39:27.360
I brought back.

39:27.590 --> 39:28.280
Besides,

39:28.550 --> 39:30.230
when you saved Luoluo and me before,

39:30.230 --> 39:32.230
you never worried about the danger.

39:32.550 --> 39:33.840
Xiao Yao, do you think

39:33.840 --> 39:35.000
I'm too talkative?

39:35.000 --> 39:35.510
Do I annoy you?

39:35.510 --> 39:36.920
I can be quiet if you want.

39:38.510 --> 39:40.910
To Pingjiang Prefecture. To find Bingzhu.

39:40.960 --> 39:41.330
Let's go.

39:41.330 --> 39:42.150
[Pingjiang Prefecture Office]

39:44.550 --> 39:45.360
It's closed.

39:53.400 --> 39:54.290
Young ladies.

39:54.440 --> 39:55.360
The Pingjiang Prefecture Office is empty.

39:54.650 --> 40:01.460
[Pingjiang Prefecture Office]

39:55.670 --> 39:56.630
Whatever grievance you have,

39:56.630 --> 39:58.360
you should try another approach.

39:58.360 --> 39:59.400
-Where is everyone?
-Where is everyone?

39:59.400 --> 40:00.930
What do you mean by "empty"?

40:01.000 --> 40:02.000
They've all left.

40:02.000 --> 40:03.670
Feiyu Guard and Prefect have left?

40:03.670 --> 40:04.470
They're gone.

40:04.630 --> 40:05.920
Feiyu Guard captured the great demon

40:05.920 --> 40:07.320
and returned to the capital
to report their success.

40:07.320 --> 40:08.380
The prefecture office
provided valuable assistance,

40:08.380 --> 40:10.280
so Prefect has taken his family
to have an audience with the Emperor.

40:10.280 --> 40:12.070
He's surely going to be promoted again.

40:12.070 --> 40:12.630
You may go.
